---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Sumi Support — Help With Your Scientific Calculator"
  description="Find help with Sumi’s exact answers, calculation history, themes and settings, or contact the developer with a question or bug report."
>
  <section class="page-heading wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">HERE TO HELP</p>
    <h1>
      Help with <span>Sumi.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="page-intro">
      Questions, bug reports and suggestions are welcome.
      <br />
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email} ↗</a>
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="support-content wrap">
    <div class="support-intro">
      <h2>Start with an example.</h2>
      <p>
        New to Sumi? Start with our practical guides to fractions, exact answers
        and equation solving.
      </p>
      <a href="/guides/" class="text-link">
        Open the notebook <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details open>
        <summary>
          Why does Sumi show a fraction or square root?
          <span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p>
          Sumi keeps supported answers exact. Press <strong>=</strong> to
          complete your calculation, then <strong>S⇔D</strong> to switch between
          the exact form and its decimal value.{' '}
          <a href="/guides/exact-answers/">Learn about exact answers.</a>
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>
          How do I see previous calculations?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p>
          Tap the history key (the clock icon) or drag up from the keypad.
          Tapping an entry brings its expression back for editing.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>
          How do I change the theme or colours?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p>
          Open Settings with the sliders icon, then choose{' '}
          <strong>Appearance</strong>. Under Theme, choose{' '}
          <strong>Light</strong>, <strong>Dark</strong> or{' '}
          <strong>System</strong>. Under Colour, choose{' '}
          <strong>Graphite</strong> or <strong>Paper &amp; Ink</strong>.{' '}
          <strong>Wallpaper colours</strong> is also available on supported
          Android 12 or newer devices.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>
          How do I change angle units or decimal places?
          <span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p>
          Open Settings and choose <strong>Angle unit</strong> for degrees,
          radians or gradians. For decimal places, open{' '}
          <strong>Calculation → Number format → Fixed decimals</strong>, then
          set <strong>Decimal places</strong>. Other formats are Automatic,
          Small decimals and Scientific. Tap <strong>S⇔D</strong> if you are
          viewing an exact result.{' '}
          <a href="/guides/exact-answers/">
            More about exact and decimal answers.
          </a>
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>
          How do I copy a result?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p>Long-press the result to copy it to the clipboard.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>
          How do I delete my data?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p>
          Open <strong>Settings → Calculation → Memory &amp; reset</strong>,
          then choose <strong>Reset calculator</strong> to clear memory,
          calculation history and the current expression, and restore default
          calculation settings. Appearance, controls, support history and review
          prompt preferences are kept. To remove all local app data, use your
          device’s app storage controls or delete the app and its data. See the{' '}
          <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>
          What is the tip jar?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p>
          Sumi is free with no ads. Open{' '}
          <strong>Settings → Support Sumi</strong> to leave an optional one-time
          tip through your platform’s store. Tips unlock nothing and are never
          required. Purchases need an internet connection; calculations work
          offline.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>
          What should I include in a bug report?
          <span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p>
          Email the calculation and the keys you pressed, the result you
          expected, and your app version and device model. Include a screenshot
          if it helps show the issue.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
